 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Eight days passed and the doors were locked tight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The disciples gathered in the quiet night",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thomas stood among them, heart still afraid",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus came in and the peace he displayed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said to Thomas, take a look around",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Put your finger in, feel where I was bound",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stop your doubting now, believe in my grace",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My Lord and my God, Thomas said in that place",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who have not seen yet believed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their hearts are open and their souls received",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No need for sight to know the way it is",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the treasure, the quiet wish",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Many signs were done in their presence that day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not all are written for us to say",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But these are recorded so you might see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus is the Christ, the Son who set us free",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who have not seen yet believed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their hearts are open and their souls received",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No need for sight to know the way it is",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the treasure, the quiet wish",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Life in his name is the gift we hold",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the story that must be told",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without the seeing, the heart still knows",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The peace that flows from the love that glows",
